    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) has signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with the Kilifi County Government that will increase collaborative efforts in research and training. The MoU aims to coordinate development activities and research programmes of mutual interest, fostering academic and clinical partnerships between the two institutions.",
